# Rules / skills = prompts

`.mdc`, User Rules, `AGENTS.md`, and `SKILL.md` are **injected context**. Author them as prompts.

| Discipline | Meaning |
|------------|---------|
| Accurate | Match live paths, tools, ids; no invented facts; fix drift on sight |
| Precise | One concern; actionable MUST/MUSTNOT; no vague fillers |
| Low-noise | Pointers over paste; mdc < 120 lines; `alwaysApply` only if every turn needs it |
| Consistent | One SSOT per fact; no contradictory duplicates across rules / skills / AGENTS |
| Coherent | Shared terms + routing (SKILL-GRAPH -> seed.wire); constraints in rules, procedure in skills |
| Abbreviations | Prefer clear English names; expand house labels on first use |
| Positive | Name the structure positively, then the per-item gate |

